{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S05、S07 等段落的感受行偏密，短停留时容易来不及扫；S13 的“刚刚答了声是”也容易让人误以为对方真的给出了明确回应。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 虽然更密，但【】把每段最重要的心理转折凸显出来，观众不必读完所有文字也能抓住主线；分时出现的感受又让音乐变化与人物心理变化相互印证。尤其是水、船、浪、光等意象的反复发展，以及声部、力度、呼吸和身体感受的具体描写，让情绪从试探、沉醉、不安到坦然的过程更连贯、更有层次。X 的优势是画面相对清爽、叙事句子完整，但感受词较多停留在概括性的情绪描述，细节和音乐同步感不如 Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4121d526-3d88-4a6e-80ee-23952a1aa699", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T001313233848Z", "elapsed_seconds": 149.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:15:42.726649+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a295aedcaa94dcf8d569330ecfae54f2c941708e4df80f14933dfb79dd4547b3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "too